  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Rental Agreement Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a rental agreement form?\", \"a\": \"A rental agreement form is the document a landlord and tenant complete and sign to set the terms of a rental. It names the parties and the property, then the rent and the house rules. A basic rental agreement form usually runs month to month.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a rental agreement form?\", \"a\": \"Start with who rents which property and on what terms. Describe them to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>, and it turns them into a simple rental agreement form that completes the agreement from each tenant's answers.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I get a free rental agreement form?\", \"a\": \"County housing offices and state agencies publish free rental agreement forms as PDFs you print and fill by hand. To have tenants fill one online, build it with Emergent instead, and pair it with a tenant screening form for applicants you have not approved yet.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I get a free lease agreement form?\", \"a\": \"State and city agencies post free ones. The Oklahoma Department of Commerce, for example, offers a four-page Basic Rental Agreement or Residential Lease. Because a lease runs for a fixed term, check that the form you choose states both dates and what happens when the term is up.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a basic rental agreement form include?\", \"a\": \"At minimum, the name of every adult who will live in the unit, the address, the rent and its due date, and the deposit. Add the start date and, for a fixed term, the end date. Clauses for pets or parking can stay out until the property needs them.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can a simple rental agreement form be filled out online?\", \"a\": \"Yes. The tenant opens a link on a phone or laptop, types in their details, and signs on the screen. With Emergent, each finished agreement is saved to a database you own, and no response cap limits how many tenants can submit it.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the difference between a lease agreement form and a rental agreement form?\", \"a\": \"The length of the commitment. A lease agreement form locks in the rent and terms for a set period, often six months or a year. A rental agreement usually renews with each rent payment, which suits a room or a short stay. When a lease nears its end, a lease renewal form collects the tenant's decision.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I collect a security deposit with a rental lease agreement form?\", \"a\": \"Connect your own Stripe account and add a payment step after the signature, set to the deposit amount the lease names. The tenant pays by card before the agreement is final, and the payment record sits next to the signed lease.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I customize a free rental lease agreement form?\", \"a\": \"Yes, and most need it. A generic form has no idea the unit lacks parking or bills water separately. Cut the clauses that do not apply and add the ones the property needs, each in plain words that read only one way.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I make rental agreement forms for several properties?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Give each property its own form with its own rent, rules, and addenda, or build one form that asks for the unit first and then shows that building's terms. The app Emergent builds has no per-seat pricing, which lets a co-owner or property manager work from the same lease table.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}